The numbers is a list of 1, 2, 3, and 4.
The values is a list of 1, -3, -4, and 2.
The spots is a list of 0, 1, 0, and 3.
The total is 0.
For each number in numbers, if number modulo 2 is 0, add number to total.
For every which from 0 to the last position of values.
The spot is item which of spots.
The oldvalue is item spot of numbers.
If oldvalue modulo 2 is 0, subtract oldvalue from total.
Set item spot of numbers to oldvalue plus item which of values.
The fresh is item spot of numbers.
If fresh modulo 2 is 0, add fresh to total.
Show total.
